sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant UI as React + Vite UI
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Engine as Pace Engine
    participant DB as Database

    User->>UI: save goal or financial input
    UI->>API: POST/PATCH /api/v1/...<br/>session cookie + CSRF token

    Note over API: validate request<br/>enforce ownership<br/>reject missing inputs

    API->>DB: persist user-owned change
    API->>DB: load normalized planning inputs
    API->>Engine: calculate_pace(input,<br/>timestamp, time_zone)

    Note over Engine: deterministic pace-v1<br/>AI-free calculation

    Engine-->>API: safe-to-spend,<br/>shortfall, pace status
    API->>DB: insert immutable<br/>calculation snapshot
    DB-->>API: snapshot saved
    API-->>UI: dashboard JSON<br/>from snapshot
    UI-->>User: updated dashboard<br/>+ calculation details
